  (text "KEY MATRIX: columns D4-D9 driven low one at a time, rows D1-D3 read with pull-ups (see scanButtonMatrix). Diode anode to switch, cathode to column." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d651097a-898f-4b32-94ff-0d6e65610c43"))
  (text "C4 is a direct key on D10 to GND (firmware uses internal pull-up).  BTN1-6 = top-row buttons on the 6 unused matrix slots (NOTE_MAPPING -1 entries)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a72cd563-eb5c-4cf5-a51f-62f6e92bfe1a"))
  (text "POT: master volume, 10k linear on JST-XH 3-pin: 1 = +3V3A, 2 = wiper -> A0, 3 = AGND. The four bank controls are I2C encoders on J15. KEYS: panel buttons on JST-XH 2-pin, one per key." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "231f86bd-8f94-4538-bdc1-64e8b1510e3a"))
  (text "POWER: VBUS -> F1 2.5A PTC -> VUSB -> U5 charger (power path) -> VSYS -> U6 boost -> +5V for Seed VIN and the amp. 5.1k CC pull-downs advertise a 1.5A sink. U4 = ESD on D+/D-." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f199d4e0-aae5-4988-b73c-069e6ed58a80"))
  (text "USB-C data to D29/D30 = Daisy 'external' USB. In firmware use MidiUsbTransport::Config::EXTERNAL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e61d2bc-ad89-4e49-8d9e-c7cfafb6bc82"))
  (text "AMP: MAX98306 on board, single-ended inputs (1u caps, - inputs to GND). Gain: R13 100k to PVDD = 9 dB, JP1 straps GAIN to GND (18 dB) or PVDD (12 dB). Outputs -> ferrite + 220p EMI filter -> JST-PH." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39c8b0c5-32b0-407f-beaa-2e50a55c90ff"))
  (text "Outputs are bridge-tied: NO series caps on the speakers, never join L- and R-." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c835bf4-690d-4245-9828-143a0b5cd278"))
  (text "HEADPHONES: TPA6138A2 (gain -1, ground-centred output, no output caps) drives the jack. TN contact = plug detect (HP_DET, reaches 3V3: Q1 is a MOSFET). Q1 pulls the speaker amp SD low when plugged. D13 reads HP_DET, D14 = headphone mute (pulled up)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7d69eb7b-47b9-4690-b581-28196dbac57b"))
  (text "MUTE: D0 -> R6 -> Q2 (2N7002) -> AMP_SD, pulled up by R15 so the speakers are muted until firmware drives D0 low. Q1 and Q2 drains are a wired-OR on AMP_SD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39cee094-fb18-4781-82ad-990dc95e3112"))
  (text "BATTERY: BQ24074, EN2=1/EN1=0 -> 1.5A input limit (R19), 0.5A charge (R18), default timers, 10% termination, TS = 10k. VSYS = 4.4V on USB, else VBAT. ~CHG -> A5, ~PGOOD -> A11 (100k pull-ups). VBAT/2 -> A10." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 365.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "392eacb0-8170-416d-ace6-e38cc28e997d"))
  (text "BOOST: TPS61023 5.1V (750k/100k), 1uH, 10uF in, 2x22uF out + C1. EN from the panel switch on J16 (or JP2 bridged) via R28, R27 pull-down = off. Use a protected LiPo cell; J17 pin 1 = +." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "895405be-799e-4860-816e-724958fb0793"))
  (text "3V3P: AP7361C-33 LDO from +5V feeds the encoders (J15), the display (J9) and J8's 3V3 pin, so the Seed's regulator only carries the Seed, the headphone amp and pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 375.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "737c0d5b-d4b3-4547-a559-6771858c18a7"))
  (text "EXPANSION: spare Seed GPIO/ADC + 3V3/5V/GND.  DISPLAY: SPI1 (A7 SCK, A3 MOSI, A8 NSS) + D26 D/C + D27 RST.  STEMMA QT: I2C1 (D11 SCL, D12 SDA) for seesaw encoders." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "69bb6de3-37ca-42ac-a4df-f1b9928eb971"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
